  "published": "2026-10-29T09:39:51.697Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: pass the root IConfiguration to AddOidcProxy. The package configures YARP, Redis and trusted forwarded headers automatically. Move OidcProxy.Client and OidcProxy.CookiePolicy metadata to Bff:Clients:<client>:Routes, using AllowAnonymous and CookiePolicy. Native ReverseProxy configuration stays separate. Explicit internal HTTP destinations are supported behind TLS termination; public origins and OIDC Authority remain HTTPS. The encrypted session format remains compatible with 7.0.0. Documentation and the sample host are simplified.",
